flowchart LR
    User[API consumer]
    Dictionary[Linux dictionary]

    subgraph Application[Semantic Extractor]
        API[Spring Boot REST API]
        Import[Catalog import]
        Search[Lexical and semantic search]
        Provider[EmbeddingClient]
    end

    subgraph Models[Embedding providers]
        Ollama[Ollama<br/>Granite Embedding 30M]
        Watsonx[watsonx.ai<br/>Granite Embedding 278M]
    end

    Redis[(Redis Stack<br/>terms, lexical index, vector index)]

    Dictionary -->|newline-delimited terms| API
    User -->|import and search requests| API
    API --> Import
    API --> Search
    Import --> Provider
    Search --> Provider
    Provider -->|local| Ollama
    Provider -.->|cloud option| Watsonx
    Import -->|metadata and FLOAT32 vectors| Redis
    Search -->|prefix or KNN query| Redis
    Redis -->|terms and similarity scores| Search
    Search --> API
    API -->|JSON response| User

